  "text": "\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nShelby County, Iowa - County Government and Services\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n Skip to content\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n \n \n \n\n \n \n \n\n Search\n \n \n \n\n \n\n Departments \n \n\n 911 Center/EMA\n Ambulance Service\n Assessor\n Attorney\n Auditor\n Board of Supervisors\n Conservation\n Engineer\n Environmental Health\n General Assistance\n Planning & Zoning\n Public Health\n Recorder\n Shelby County Solid Waste\n Sheriff\n Treasurer\n Veteran Services\n \n \n \n\n Resources \n \n \n\n Bid Notices\n Calendar\n County Chamber of Commerce & Industry\n Courts\n Employment\n FAQ\n Notifications\n \n \n \n\n Contact\n \n \n\n About \n \n\n Boards & Commissions\n Cemeteries\n Communities\n Elected Officials\n School Districts\n \n \n \n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n \n \n Search Shelby County, Iowa\n \n\n \n \n \n\n \n \n \n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \nWelcome to Shelby County, Iowa\n \n\n \n\n \n \n Driver's License \n \n \n\n \n \n Elections \n \n \n\n \n \n Meetings \n \n \n\n \n \n Motor Vehicle \n \n \n\n \n \n Property Taxes \n \n \n\n \n \n Real Estate Search \n \n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n \nNews + Announcements\n \n\n \n\n \n\n \n \n\n \n \n\n November 10, 2025\n Zoning Amendments Restricting Hazardous Liquid Pipelines\n Board of Supervisors \n\n Read Full Article \n \n \n \n \n \n\n \n \n\n \n \n\n June 30, 2025\n Notice to Users of County General Assistance Program\n General Assistance \n\n Read Full Article \n \n \n \n \n \n \n\n \n\n \n \n\n June 3, 2025\n Reminder: 811 Call Before You Dig\n Engineer \n \n \n \n\n \n \n\n June 2, 2025\n Renew Your Passport Online\n Environmental Health \n \n \n \n\n \n \n\n April 7, 2025\n Public Notices: Public Hearing - FY26 Proposed Budget\n Auditor \n \n \n \n \n \n\n View All News \n \n\n\n\n\n\n \nWhat's Happening\n \n\n \n\n \nMonday · October 19 \n \n\n Voter Pre-Registration Deadline\n 612 Court St. · Harlan, IA \n \n\n \nVoter Pre-Registration Deadline\n 612 Court St.\n Harlan, IA\n Map to Event\n \n\n October 19, 2026 \n\nPre-Registration Deadline for General Election on November 3rd \n\n \n \n\n Last Day to mail Absentee Ballot\n 8:00 am\n 612 Court Street · Harlan, IA \n \n\n \nLast Day to mail Absentee Ballot\n 612 Court Street\n Harlan, IA\n Map to Event\n \n\n October 19, 2026 \n 8:00 am · 5:00 pm \n\n \n For More Information\n \nContact: Auditor's Office \n(712) 755-3831 \nauditor@shelbycounty.iowa.gov \nWebsite \n\n Posted by: Auditor \n\n \n \n \n\n \nTuesday · October 20 \n \n\n Board of Supervisors Meeting\n 9:00 am\n 612 Court St. · Harlan, IA \n \n\n \nBoard of Supervisors Meeting\n 612 Court St.\n Harlan, IA\n Map to Event\n \n\n October 20, 2026 \n 9:00 am \n\nThe Shelby County Board of Supervisors generally meets on the 1st and 3rd Tuesdays at 9:00 am in the Supervisors room at the Shelby County Courthouse at 612 Court St. in Harlan. Posted by: Board of Supervisors \n\n \n \n \n\n \nFriday · October 30 \n \n\n Auditor's Office open until 5:00pm\n 8:00 am\n 612 Court Street · Harlan, IA \n \n\n \nAuditor's Office open until 5:00pm\n 612 Court Street\n Harlan, IA\n Map to Event\n \n\n October 30, 2026 \n 8:00 am · 5:00 pm \n\n \n For More Information\n \nContact: Auditor's Office \n(712) 755-3831 \nauditor@shelbycounty.iowa.gov \nWebsite \n\n Posted by: Auditor \n\n \n \n\n Early Voting Begins\n 8:00 am\n 612 Court Street · Harlan, IA \n \n\n \nEarly Voting Begins\n 612 Court Street\n Harlan, IA\n Map to Event\n \n\n October 30, 2026 \n 8:00 am · 5:00 pm \n\n \n For More Information\n \nContact: Auditor's Office \n(712) 755-3831 \nauditor@shelbycounty.iowa.gov \nWebsite \n\n Posted by: Auditor \n\n \n \n \n\n \nTuesday · November 3 \n \n\n General Election 2026\n 7:00 am\n \n \n\n \nGeneral Election 2026\n Harlan, IA\n \n\n November 3, 2026 \n 7:00 am · 8:00 pm \n\nGeneral Election 2026 \n\n \n \n \n \n\n View Full Calendar \n \n\n\n\n\n \nAbout the County \n \n\nEstablished in 1851, Shelby County is a collection of 15 communities and is home to nearly 12,000 residents. The county is named for General Isaac Shelby, a Revolutionary War veteran. Shelby County is administered by a three-member Board of Supervisors, who are elected to four-year terms. Other elected officials include the Attorney, Auditor, Recorder, Sheriff, and Treasurer. \n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n \n\n \nExplore Shelby County\n \nShelby County Chamber of Commerce\n \n\n \nDiscover the many attractions, festivals, shops, and outdoor adventures awaiting in Shelby County! \n \n \nPlan Your Trip\n \n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n \n\n County Courthouse\n 612 Court St.\n \nHarlan, IA 51537\n\n Contact Us\n \n \n\n \n \n \n\n Courthouse Hours\n Hours May Vary\n\n View Hours by Department\n\n Closed Holidays\n\n \n \n\n\n\n\n \n\n \n©2026 Shelby County | \nTranslate LanguageTranslate Website\n \npowered by \n \n\n\n\n\n \nUpcoming Holiday Closure Schedule\n \n \nVeterans' Day (November 11, 2026)\n \nThanksgiving Day (November 26, 2026)\n \nFriday after Thanksgiving (November 27, 2026)\n \nChristmas Eve Day (December 24, 2026)\n \nChristmas Day (December 25, 2026)\n \nNew Year's Day (January 1, 2027)\n \n\n"
